s://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2018-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael E. Hoffman","x":"You're getting both absolute price increase as well as the benefit of mix?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2018-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"We expect negative adjusted EBITDA in our Corporate segment to also increase at a rate approaching mid-teens from 2017, due to costs from acquisitions and higher incentive compensation and benefits, including 401(k) outweighing our ongoing cost saving programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2018-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"So there was a significant amount of cost savings and headcount savings as part of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2018-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"The price/mix efforts in our incineration network was really what carried us through in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2018-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"We are examining new and different ways to apply artificial intelligence and data analytics to streamline many of our internal functions and to improve on safety.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2018-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"We're hopeful that kind of streamline some of that from the collection efforts that we have in our business to make it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2019-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"The Safety-Kleen team did a great job throughout 2018, capitalizing on positive pricing trends, as well as managing the spread between our used motor oil and base oil.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2019-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Luke Junk","x":"And then I guess speak -- Alan just the outlook for incinerator pricing in 2019, obviously steady economic backdrop good utilization, high barriers to entry in that business of course, it seems like a good backdrop to take price?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"And we are also pursuing a broad array of cost savings initiatives again this year that we believe will offset these workforce investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2018 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"In our corporate segment, negative adjusted EBITDA should be flat to slightly higher in 2018, as increases in areas like healthcare and benefits including 401K are mostly offset by cost saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2019-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"And I say that kind of gets back plus in Q2 given the price increases we saw late March and early April as well as our ability to drive, kind of, CFO.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"We are also pursuing a broad array of cost-savings initiatives again this year that we believe will offset the investments that we have made in our workforce and help us increase our margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"In our corporate segment, we now expect a negative adjusted EBITDA to grow by mid-single digits in 2018 as increases in areas like salaries, healthcare and benefits, including 401(k), are mostly offset by cost-saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2019-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"And so we feel like -- if it's creating tariffs affecting of our customers, that could be a problem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2019-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Hoffman","x":"And then how sensitive is your guidance to sentiment around trade and tariffs related to your customer base?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"Revenue this quarter, we're up about 2%, and we achieved adjusted EBITDA growth of 7% on the strength of our business mix, our cost-savings initiatives, and pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"Safety-Kleen's adjusted EBITDA rose 9% and margins improved 120 basis points to 26% due to the higher revenue, our ongoing pricing improvement programs and cost-reduction initiatives within the branches.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"And so the market is somewhat long right now, and we just recently did put out a price increase because of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"And, Noah, one point I want to add to Alan's comments is that although we didn't do a price increase, and I think that we're -- as Alan said, we're seeing kind of signs of life, there's not much of an impact in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"This improvement was driven by a series of cost-saving initiatives, as well as efficiencies achieved through our Safety-Kleen customer care center, which we have invested in over the past two years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"I don't think we raised guidance in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"And so we've tried to say kind of base oil pricing kind of as it stands today, with the price increases and the price decreases, we have -- as we always try to do this, we try to take up kind of where it is today, and that can change obviously tomorrow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"We're walking away from unprofitable clients, we're trying to raise price, and as such, the revenue is down a bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"In 2020, as we have in prior years, we're pursuing a broad array of cost savings that, we believe, will more than offset these investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2019 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"We'll continue to drive our cost-saving initiatives to offset these higher insurance costs as well as to continue to focus on safety to lower incidents and incident severity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Noah Kaye","x":"How are you thinking about kind of price/mix trends in the second quarter so far?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"Starting with alignment of our cost structure with the demand environment, we are rightsizing our workforce through furloughs and other reductions and implemented a nonbillable hiring and wage freeze, and we restricted all travel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"As we move forward, we are focusing much of our cost reduction efforts in this area to bring expenses in line with our revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Alan McKim","x":"As noted in this morning's earnings release, given the current market uncertainty, we're withdrawing our annual guidance for 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Battles","x":"As Alan also noted, given the uncertain market environment, we would -- we are withdrawing our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"We continue to look at mix as the most important thing right now for us that's in our control, but I would tell you that we've taken our foot off the gas on price increases right now realizing where our customers are.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"We've held off on any new price increases realizing where everybody is and dealing with this pandemic and we'll probably we look at that in January, but I think the price number that you will see is going to be really reflective of of the mix right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"Adjusted EBITDA grew 17% as a result of our cost reduction efforts, a strong performance in our facilities, emergency response revenue and the two government programs which accounted for $13.3 million in this segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"Adjusted EBITDA declined 41% due to the lower revenue, pricing for our SK Oil products and costs associated with the temporary shuttering of our refineries, partly offset by cost reduction efforts and government assistance programs which totaled $8.3 million dollars for this segment in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"This increase was attributable in part to our cost reduction efforts, productivity improvements and a healthy mix of higher margin work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"This decline was partly offset by our cost reduction initiatives, as well as the government assistance programs that provided $2.5 million to this segment in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2020-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Given our performance, and based on current market conditions, we are raising our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"But our goal this year is to normalize our pricing again, and we've recently raised prices on our incineration business, particularly because of just sheer demand and volume So I think there's some price improvements in there, both on concessions getting back to normal and the price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2020 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"This was driven by a combination of business mix, cost savings and $3.9 million in benefits from government assistance programs in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"We expect our refinery -- our Re-refinery business to have an outstanding year as the spread we manage in that business is extremely wide due to supply driven price increases in base oil and blended products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"We do see growth from the captive markets, we're seeing new volumes coming in and we were implementing an 8% price increase pretty much for all of our incineration business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"Even so, our margins were up 70 basis points and this was driven by a combination of pricing, cost savings, revenue mix and $4.5 million in government assistance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Our cost reduction programs, productivity initiatives and mix of revenue, combined with $5.4 million of government program assistance, resulted in 130 basis points improvement in gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Based on our strong Q1 results and current market conditions, we are raising our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Normally, we don't even raise guidance in Q1, as you know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"…of adjusted EBITDA would also put us approximately 45% above what this segment achieved in 2019, which demonstrates how well we are managing the business, the impact of IMO 2020 on our markets and the super-sized spread caused by supply driven price increases in base oil and blended products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael McDonald","x":"The biggest pieces, the spread being wide and the price increases that we've had in the back half of Q2 and here in Q3, that really were a 40% increase and a 30% increase and our ability to kind of manage the front end of the spread on the CFO pricing, that really led to kind of a super-sized…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"Our margins increased 80 basis points to 20.3% reflecting the benefits of pricing initiatives and cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"These factors were offset by higher revenue, cost savings and favorable mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Moving to slide 15; based on our Q2 results and current market conditions, we are raising our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2021-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael McDonald","x":"We expected it was going to be a good year, but they really had -- that revenue is up 50% from prior year, again, I thought that was a really great result and I'm encouraged by the back half, kind of the Q3 turnarounds that we have coming up and as such that raised our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alan S. McKim","x":"We met those head on, putting in place a multitude of necessary price increases to offset the rising expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"…was largely offset -- will largely be offset by other factors, including necessary and extensive price increases, higher profitability in our incineration business, gains in our Safety-Kleen branches, Field Service and Industrial Services, including the addition of HPC in Q4, and our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"On a percentage basis, SG&A was up 30 basis points from a year ago at 14%, largely due to higher incentive compensation, as well as severance and integration costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"This assumes approximately $15 million of contribution from HPC in the quarter reflecting up to $5 million in integration costs including severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"Turning to slide 12, based on our Q3 results, the closing of the HPC transaction and current market conditions, we are raising our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2021 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael L. Battles","x":"And as we sit here talking to you, I don't see that happening, so as such, that's allowed us to raise our guidance again in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/clean-harbors-inc-clh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CLH 2025 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"Tariff-related uncertainty and other macro factors in the North American economy have ripple effects through some of our customers over the past two quarters, but we believe the overall economic outlook remains promising.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2025 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Gerstenberg","x":"…margin growth continues to be a focus for us, and we were pleased to see our consolidated adjusted EBITDA margin increased by 100 basis points from a year ago, 20.7%, demonstrating the effectiveness of our pricing, the leverage in our network of permitted facilities, and cost-saving strategies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2025 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric Gerstenberg","x":"Corporate segment costs were up from a year ago, primarily due to higher insurance expenses and healthcare increases, offset partially by cost-cutting actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2025 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2026-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric W. Gerstenberg","x":"Safety underpins everything we do at Clean Harbors, Inc., and I have outlined the many benefits on prior calls, such as reputation, teamwork, employee retention, and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2025 Q4","e":"clh","d":"2026-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Eric J. Dugas","x":"While we continue to experience some inflationary pressure across Corporate cost categories, we have numerous cost savings and productivity initiatives underway that are expected to offset a meaningful portion of these headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/18/clean-harbors-clh-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"That base oil price increase and the work the team has done to manage our costs over the past year has led to a meaningful rise in profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"It's almost a pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"And normally, we don't raise guidance after 90 days in the quarter, whether we -- unless there's an M&A or something like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q1","e":"clh","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"So the fact that we're raising guidance on both segments here just after just giving guidance 6, 7 weeks ago should tell you about our view as we think about the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clean-harbors-clh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"Strong demand for our re-refined products was a result of major global supply disruptions in the Middle East and Asia, which created domestic market scarcity and drove multiple price increases in the market during Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jerry Revich","x":"Is it an option to enter into long-term contracts, maybe we shave the peak and maybe improve the trough price realization?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2026-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Eric Dugas","x":"We did raise the guide for the full year, about $30 million, $10 million of that is Terra Nova.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q2","e":"clh","d":"2026-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Battles","x":"And as Q3 is strong, as Eric Dugas mentioned, it does -- we do have base oil pricing coming down in Q4, and that's leading to a lower guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/clean-harbors-clh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLH 2026 Q3","e":"clh","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Eric Gerstenberg","x":"…delivered its 18th consecutive quarter of year-over-year adjusted EBITDA margin expansion with a margin of 27.4% as we continue to demonstrate our ability to price effectively, properly allocate capital to acquisitions and internal projects, take cost out of the business and drive productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/clean-harbors-clh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,6656,0,0,0,4951,1241],[35,1,8672,0,0,0,6207,1834],[36,1,7169,0,0,0,5381,1270],[37,1,6359,0,0,0,4774,1259],[38,1,6598,0,0,0,5008,1246],[39,1,8015,0,0,0,5770,1814],[40,1,7774,0,0,0,6164,1209],[41,1,9797,0,0,0,6745,2493],[42,1,8612,0,0,0,6382,1644],[43,1,8313,0,0,0,6295,1568],[44,1,9432,0,0,0,6964,1927],[45,1,8701,0,0,0,6465,1735],[46,1,10482,0,0,0,7975,1885],[47,1,7142,0,0,0,5507,1170],[63,1,9823,0,0,0,7791,1628],[64,1,9914,0,0,0,8012,1320],[65,1,7042,0,0,0,5628,1126],[66,1,10946,0,0,0,4835,5706],[67,1,11930,0,0,0,5639,5855]],"cinema":[[34,1,6656,0,0,0,4951,1241],[35,1,8672,0,0,0,6207,1834],[36,1,7169,0,0,0,5381,1270],[37,1,6359,0,0,0,4774,1259],[38,1,6598,0,0,0,5008,1246],[39,1,8015,0,0,0,5770,1814],[40,1,7774,0,0,0,6164,1209],[41,1,9797,0,0,0,6745,2493],[42,1,8612,0,0,0,6382,1644],[43,1,8313,0,0,0,6295,1568],[44,1,9432,0,0,0,6964,1927],[45,1,8701,0,0,0,6465,1735],[46,1,10482,0,0,0,7975,1885],[47,1,7142,0,0,0,5507,1170],[63,1,9823,0,0,0,7791,1628],[64,1,9914,0,0,0,8012,1320],[65,1,7042,0,0,0,5628,1126],[66,1,10946,0,0,0,4835,5706],[67,1,11930,0,0,0,5639,5855]],"imax":[[34,1,6656,0,0,0,4951,1241],[35,1,8672,0,0,0,6207,1834],[36,1,7169,0,0,0,5381,1270],[37,1,6359,0,0,0,4774,1259],[38,1,6598,0,0,0,5008,1246],[39,1,8015,0,0,0,5770,1814],[40,1,7774,0,0,0,6164,1209],[41,1,9797,0,0,0,6745,2493],[42,1,8612,0,0,0,6382,1644],[43,1,8313,0,0,0,6295,1568],[44,1,9432,0,0,0,6964,1927],[45,1,8701,0,0,0,6465,1735],[46,1,10482,0,0,0,7975,1885],[47,1,7142,0,0,0,5507,1170],[63,1,9823,0,0,0,7791,1628],[64,1,9914,0,0,0,8012,1320],[65,1,7042,0,0,0,5628,1126],[66,1,10946,0,0,0,4835,5706],[67,1,11930,0,0,0,5639,5855]],"streaming":[[34,1,6656,0,0,0,4951,1241],[35,1,8672,0,0,0,6207,1834],[36,1,7169,0,0,0,5381,1270],[37,1,6359,0,0,0,4774,1259],[38,1,6598,0,0,0,5008,1246],[39,1,8015,0,0,0,5770,1814],[40,1,